{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>גר</b> — the place breaks open, a wadi that is גר, and the matter is like water that is swept away, until it is forgotten from people's treading it much." "<b>דלו</b> — like דללו, and it is destroyed." "<b>מאנוש</b> — that they wander, for they go and move about."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:03:49.777145419Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}